    anatomy: ['Direction — dir="rtl" or "ltr" on <html> or a region, set by DirectionProvider from the locale (required)', 'Logical properties — start and end in every stylesheet, so the layout mirrors on its own (required)', 'Directional icons — chevrons, arrows, undo and redo, which mirror; other icons keep their shape (required)', 'Script helpers — arrowStep and physicalSide for arrow keys and measurements (optional)', 'Rule — Stylelint’s plenix/logical-properties, which rejects left and right in component stylesheets (required)'],
